==Battleground==
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 3~4 seconds<sup>90f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*30 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and/or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] can be helpful here, while anything that can take out Johnnyleon quicker can speed up the stage. Relic Doges are the only peon, but they do spawn often. Once you take out the Shadow Boxer Ks, the Othom and Relic Doges are the only things left, and they shouldn't push too hard.

Alternatively, you can take advantage of the minute you have before Othom and Johnnyleon spawn by using rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], or any available rushers like [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]] along with Starting Money Up [[Cat Combo]]s to quickly take down the enemy base's 950k HP.

